<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5875" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Būsīris</span></b> , ĭdis
			and ĭdos (ĭdis, <i><span class="en">Verg. G. 3,
		5</span></i>; <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ìdos,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Stat.
					Th. 12, 155</span></i>
			; acc. Busiridem, <i><span class="en">Quint. 2, 7,
				4</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Hyg. Fab. 31</span></i>; <i><span class="en">56</span></i>; Serv.ad <i><span class="en">Verg. A. 8,
				300</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Busirin,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. A.
					A. 1, 649</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">id. M. 9, 183</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Busirim,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Amm. 28, 1, 46</span></i>
			), = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Βούσῖρις</span>.
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Masc.</i>, <i>a king of Egypt</i>,
				<i>who sacrificed strangers</i>, <i>and was himself slain by Hercules</i>, <i><span class="en">Cic. Rep.
				3, 9, 15</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Verg. G. 3, 5</span></i>; Mythogr. Lat. 1, 65;
			2, 157; <i><span class="en">Ov. Tr. 3, 11, 39</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">Macr. S. 3, 5,
			9</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Fem.</i>, <i>a considerable town in
				Lower Egypt</i>, <i>with a temple of Isis</i>,
			now <i>Abousir</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 5, 10,
				11, § 64</span></i>.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>A village near the Great Pyramid</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 36,
				12, 16, § 76</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
